{"id":"432468","name":"菠菜冻豆腐汤","author":"烟雨心灵","authorId":"1846401","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/432468/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"冻豆腐","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜洗净。","img":"images/432468/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"入沸水中汆烫。","img":"images/432468/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出过凉水。","img":"images/432468/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切段备用。","img":"images/432468/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冻豆腐适量。","img":"images/432468/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里加少许油，爆香葱姜。","img":"images/432468/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加一大碗水。","img":"images/432468/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开后下冻豆腐。","img":"images/432468/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"中小火煮至冻豆腐化透。","img":"images/432468/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"下菠菜。","img":"images/432468/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加盐调味，拌匀，再次烧开。","img":"images/432468/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅前加点胡椒粉，加不加随意。","img":"images/432468/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"清淡好喝的菠菜冻豆腐汤就做好了。冬季来碗这样的汤，暖身又不怕胖。","img":"images/432468/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}